      <!-- STEP13: ShaderType, ShaderModel and ObjectFileOutput used to be set
           for Debug|x64 only (ObjectFileOutput also had a Debug|Win32 case,
           but without a matching ShaderType/ShaderModel). Building anything
           other than Debug|x64, Release|x64 included, a likely pick for a
           final contest build, meant this .hlsl either failed to compile or
           did not land in shader\unlitTexturePS.cso, so edits to the source
           here could silently never reach the .cso the game actually loads
           at runtime. Now covers all 4 configurations the same way. -->
